Built with [TheoKit](https://theokit.dev) — Full-Stack TypeScript for AI Agents.

## Getting Started

```bash
# Install dependencies
npm install

# Set your LLM API key
cp .env.example .env
# Edit .env with your OpenRouter/Anthropic/OpenAI key

# Start development server
bun dev
# or: npm run dev:node
```

